<details class="admin-resource-intervention" id="colony-{{ planet.id }}"><summary>Corriger les ressources de {{ planet.name }}</summary>
<p>Ajout ou retrait sur cette colonie uniquement. La correction entière est refusée si un stock devient négatif ou dépasse un entrepôt.</p>
<form method="post" action="{{ path('app_admin_player_resources',{id:player.id,planetId:planet.id}) }}" class="admin-intervention-form">
<input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('admin_resources_'~planet.id) }}"><input type="hidden" name="request_key" value="{{ stocks[planet.id].request_key }}">
<label for="resource-operation-{{ planet.id }}">Type de correction</label><select id="resource-operation-{{ planet.id }}" name="operation"><option value="add">Ajouter</option><option value="remove">Retirer</option></select>
{% for slug,stock in stocks[planet.id].resources %}<label for="resource-{{ planet.id }}-{{ slug }}">{{ stock.label }} — stock {{ stock.stock|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} / {{ stock.capacity|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }}</label><input id="resource-{{ planet.id }}-{{ slug }}" name="amounts[{{ slug }}]" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="0" required>{% endfor %}
<label for="resource-reason-{{ planet.id }}">Motif de la correction (obligatoire)</label><textarea id="resource-reason-{{ planet.id }}" name="reason" maxlength="1000" required></textarea>
<label class="admin-intervention-confirm"><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="1" required> Je confirme les quantités, la colonie et le motif indiqués.</label>
<button class="secondary" type="submit">Appliquer la correction</button></form></details>
